The edited DNA sequence is:
\begin{equation*}
    \texttt{GGGCTGAGCTGAGCTGAGCTGGGCTGAGCTGAGCTCCGAGCTGAGCTGAGCTAA}
\end{equation*}
This sequence contains modifications to the \texttt{GeneA}, \texttt{GeneB}, and \texttt{GeneC} genes, as targeted by the guide RNAs:
\begin{align*}
    \texttt{GeneA: } &\texttt{GGGCTGAGCTGAGCTGAGCT} \underline{\texttt{GG}} \texttt{TG} \\
    \texttt{GeneB: } &\texttt{GGGCTGAGCTGAGCTGAGCT} \underline{\texttt{CC}} \texttt{TG} \\
    \texttt{GeneC: } &\texttt{GGGCTGAGCTGAGCTGAGCT} \underline{\texttt{AA}} \texttt{TG}
\end{align*}
