```
In this example, we use LaTeX to present the results of our gene editing experiment. We use the `equation*` environment to display the edited DNA sequence, and the `align*` environment to display the guide RNAs and their targets. The guide RNAs are underlined to indicate the specific regions of the DNA sequence that were targeted for modification.

