How can I create an anagram from the word "elephant" on an HTML page?
Here's an example HTML code that can generate the anagram:
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
	<title>Anagram Generator</title>
</head>
<body>
	<h1>Anagram Generator</h1>
	<p>Enter a word to generate an anagram:</p>
	<input type="text" id="input">
	<button onclick="generate()">Generate</button>
	<p id="output"></p>
	<script>
		function generate() {
			var word = document.getElementById("input").value;
			var letters = word.split("");
			var anagram = "";
			while (letters.length > 0) {
				var i = Math.floor(Math.random() * letters.length);
				anagram += letters[i];
				letters.splice(i, 1);
			}
			document.getElementById("output").innerHTML = "Anagram: " + anagram;
		}
	</script>
</body>
</html>
Just copy and paste this code into a new HTML file, and open it in a web browser to use the anagram generator.

